# Generic deny-list for files that must never be committed, in case any of
# the tracked folders are ever un-ignored.
**/*tracker*
**/*Tracker*
**/*confidential*
**/*Confidential*
**/*internal-only*
**/*NDA*
**/*.customer.*
**/*.pfx
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
